  Both sleeves, same experiment:

                          MOMENTUM Pt3      REVERSAL Pt3
    Pt_orig val metric      0.586 (Sharpe)   0.820 (Sortino)
    MC best val metric      0.711 (Sharpe)   1.101 (Sortino)
